---
description: Use Bun for install, scripts, tests, and bundles in this starter.
globs: package.json,*.js,*.jsx,*.css,*.njk,*.vto
alwaysApply: false
---

Use Bun, not npm, pnpm, yarn, Node, Vite, or webpack.

- `bun install` / `bun run <script>` / `bun test` / `Bun.build`
- Browser entry is `app/App.js`. CSS entry is `styles/styles.css`. Dev is `bun run dev` (`server/dev.js` once built).
- Do not add React, Vue, Svelte, Tailwind, or Vite. Documents are rendered by the project renderer (Nunjucks, Vento, or JSX at build time).
- Do not use Bun HTML imports as the app model. That path was measured and rejected (ADR 0020).
